# --- generated build output ---------------------------------------------
# This folder IS a `next build` export (the contents of `out/`), so most of it
# is produced by the build. If you are versioning it, keep the files that make
# the wallpaper work and ignore the noise a dev checkout leaves behind.

# node / npm
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# next.js dev server leftovers. The exported site itself lives in `_next/`,
# and that one IS needed at runtime — do not ignore it.
.next/
.vercel/

# editor / IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# OS junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# local scratch
*.log
*.tmp
temp/
tmp/
.cache/

# anything you drop in while experimenting with viewpoints or themes
# (uncomment if you keep experiments alongside the wallpaper)
# experiments/